# docs-local (local only, gitignored)

`docs-local/` holds project decisions and task context. It is never committed.

## Layout

```
docs-local/
  README.md
  decisions/          # ADRs and cross-cutting choices
  tasks/<slug>/     # One folder per task (plan, notes, review)
  releases/<version>/ # Release notes and scope per version
```

Bootstrap if missing:

```bash
cp -R .cursor/templates/docs-local docs-local
```

## When to read / write

| Phase | Action |
|-------|--------|
| Start task | Read `decisions/` + related `tasks/`; write `tasks/<slug>/plan.md` |
| During work | Append to `tasks/<slug>/notes.md` for non-obvious choices |
| Before PR | Update `tasks/<slug>/review.md`; link release folder if applicable |

Keep entries short: goal, constraints, decisions, acceptance criteria, open questions.
